00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:21.889
There's only one way out of the Phantom Zone.

00:02:21.889 --> 00:02:24.889
It has to be activated by a member of my family.

00:02:24.889 --> 00:02:26.889
The House of El.

00:02:26.889 --> 00:02:29.889
Well, I'd say Slade's living proof that someone stole your family key

00:02:29.889 --> 00:02:41.780
to never, never escape land.

