00:23:38.579 --> 00:23:41.579
The thing is we took care of that. We blocked them.

00:23:41.579 --> 00:23:48.259
Took care of his three little minions, too.

00:23:48.259 --> 00:23:52.259
Calhull might delude himself as usual if he's one, but...

00:23:52.259 --> 00:23:57.259
There are millions, millions on Earth just waiting to surrender to the will of Darkside and you.

00:23:57.259 --> 00:24:02.559
You, friend are one of them.

00:24:02.559 --> 00:24:21.039
I know exactly what you're doing.

00:24:21.039 --> 00:24:24.640
But you know it's true, don't you?

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:25.640
And it goes way back.

00:24:25.640 --> 00:24:31.279
After your parents were murdered, that anger,

00:24:31.279 --> 00:24:34.279
and desire for revenge.

00:24:34.279 --> 00:24:37.279
Ah, you can feel it now, can't you?

00:24:37.279 --> 00:24:48.059
That bubbling under the surface

00:24:48.059 --> 00:24:49.059
terrifies you.

00:24:49.059 --> 00:24:57.680
Too late.

00:24:57.680 --> 00:24:59.680
You're an agent of Darkside now.

00:24:59.680 --> 00:25:01.680
Just one of the many sinful souls at this Beacon call.

00:25:01.680 --> 00:25:02.680
at his beckling cruel.

00:25:02.680 --> 00:25:06.119
What would Clark think?

00:25:06.119 --> 00:25:16.990
Knowing you were a marked man.

00:25:16.990 --> 00:25:17.990
Stand by me.

00:25:17.990 --> 00:25:20.990
But his faith in you would be compromised.

00:25:20.990 --> 00:25:22.990
That mistrust it would grow.

00:25:22.990 --> 00:25:26.299
It would manifest like a cancer.

00:25:26.299 --> 00:25:30.299
Inevitably, you'll be cast aside out of his good graces, like I was.

00:25:30.299 --> 00:25:48.039
We can rule here, together, as brothers.

00:25:48.039 --> 00:25:50.039
I was looking for a brother in Calell.

00:25:50.039 --> 00:25:52.039
I was.

00:25:52.039 --> 00:25:55.039
Ultimately, I realize we have nothing in common.

00:25:55.039 --> 00:26:11.279
Unlike you and I.

00:26:11.279 --> 00:26:22.109
I said the bar pretty high for me.

00:26:22.109 --> 00:26:28.440
Callow would never embrace his dark sight and because of that,

00:26:28.440 --> 00:26:32.440
he will die here, but you can be saved.

00:26:32.440 --> 00:26:35.440
If you're brave enough to walk along that darker path,

00:26:35.440 --> 00:26:43.529
to draw from that darkness.

00:26:43.529 --> 00:26:48.529
Because if you don't, you will die.

00:26:48.529 --> 00:32:10.240
Tripling wounds, that had worse?

00:32:10.240 --> 00:32:12.240
From friendly fire?

00:32:12.240 --> 00:32:15.579
Wasn't really part of the plan.

00:32:15.579 --> 00:32:16.579
Well, come on now, you were the man with the plan.

00:32:16.579 --> 00:32:17.980
Now you were the man with the plan.

00:32:17.980 --> 00:32:19.579
It gives Zod to pit us against each other,

00:32:19.579 --> 00:32:21.079
knowing that he'd want to finish you off himself.

00:32:21.079 --> 00:32:22.579
It's very smart.

00:32:22.579 --> 00:32:24.079
Gave us a chance to grab the crystal.

00:32:24.079 --> 00:32:26.079
But the plan isn't why we're here.

00:32:26.079 --> 00:32:29.650
We're here because we trusted each other.

00:32:29.650 --> 00:32:33.650
I knew that whatever Zod said to Oliver, he'd still follow through.

00:32:33.650 --> 00:32:34.650
Yeah.

00:32:34.650 --> 00:32:37.150
No, it's had to reel him in somehow, right?

00:32:37.150 --> 00:32:39.150
I'm really glad you guys are back.

00:32:39.150 --> 00:32:42.150
But I think I'm gonna have to call Dr. Emile to take a look at that.

00:32:42.150 --> 00:32:50.630
Clark, those omegas that we saw at the gate.

00:32:50.630 --> 00:32:53.130
Seems like the darkness is everywhere.

00:32:53.130 --> 00:32:56.019
It comes back.

00:32:56.019 --> 00:33:18.079
What if one of us were to get infected with the darkness?

00:33:18.079 --> 00:33:19.079
What do we do then?

00:33:19.079 --> 00:33:22.549
We'd have to lock them up.

00:33:22.549 --> 00:33:26.440
Darkness is a powerful thing.

00:33:26.440 --> 00:33:28.440
It almost got me once.

00:33:28.440 --> 00:33:34.119
And once it gets in, I don't think there's a way out.

00:33:34.119 --> 00:33:41.440
Yeah, hey, I mean, at least we took care of Zad, right?

00:33:41.440 --> 00:33:44.690
Can't say I'll be missing that guy.

00:33:44.690 --> 00:33:46.690
That's one of the things he said.

00:33:46.690 --> 00:33:49.690
Half the things that come out of his mouth are a lie.

00:33:49.690 --> 00:33:52.690
He knows how to take the greatest fear you have about yourself

00:33:52.690 --> 00:33:53.690
and use it against you.

00:33:53.690 --> 00:33:59.970
Tell you what, I know someone's dark.

00:33:59.970 --> 00:34:01.970
I'll never see her fiance again.

00:34:01.970 --> 00:34:03.970
Clark Lois has got to be worried sick.

00:34:03.970 --> 00:34:05.970
You should go see her.

00:34:05.970 --> 00:34:07.970
This is nothing. I'll be fine.

00:34:07.970 --> 00:34:51.030
Go and get out of here.

00:34:51.030 --> 00:34:52.030
I knew you'd make it.

00:34:52.030 --> 00:34:53.030
I told you I would.

00:34:53.030 --> 00:34:58.780
What happened to taking the time to merge our lives together?

00:34:58.780 --> 00:35:04.179
Finding the right place for everything?

00:35:04.179 --> 00:35:06.179
Oh, you know me?

00:35:06.179 --> 00:35:09.179
Waiting isn't exactly my strong suit.

00:35:09.179 --> 00:35:12.179
So I guess nervous energy equals power unpacking.

00:35:12.179 --> 00:35:14.179
But what'd you do?

00:35:14.179 --> 00:35:15.179
Unless John Jones and Bart?

00:35:15.179 --> 00:35:29.159
There's no way that you could have...

00:35:29.159 --> 00:35:30.159
Three weeks.

00:35:30.159 --> 00:35:33.659
We were only in there a few hours.

00:35:33.659 --> 00:35:39.440
The crystal crushing, it must have altered time.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:42.440
So a few hours for me, it was almost a month for you.

00:35:42.440 --> 00:35:48.860
You waited all that time.

00:35:48.860 --> 00:35:52.860
Or the league decided that it wasn't saved to send any more people in

00:35:52.860 --> 00:35:59.360
after you, so Tess and I took turns camping out at Watchtower?

00:35:59.360 --> 00:36:01.360
Trying to re-establish contact with you and Oliver.

00:36:01.360 --> 00:36:10.219
Brought the pillow with me for downtime because,

00:36:10.219 --> 00:36:11.219
well, it reminds me.

00:36:11.219 --> 00:36:13.219
Well, it reminds me of you now.

00:36:13.219 --> 00:36:25.239
Silly, huh?

00:36:25.239 --> 00:36:27.239
After three hours, Tess was supposed...

00:36:27.239 --> 00:36:29.239
Blow up the gate.

00:36:29.239 --> 00:36:38.289
Tess and I had a little unexpected heart-to-heart about your secret plan.

00:36:38.289 --> 00:36:49.519
I brought her around to seeing things my way.

00:36:49.519 --> 00:36:54.570
I just... I wish you could have had a little faith in me, too.

00:36:54.570 --> 00:36:57.570
Lois, I didn't want you to have to make that kind of choice.

00:36:57.570 --> 00:36:59.570
I was trying to...

00:36:59.570 --> 00:37:01.570
Protect me.

00:37:01.570 --> 00:37:05.489
I know.

00:37:05.489 --> 00:37:06.489
Part of me now, Clark.

00:37:06.489 --> 00:37:09.059
A half of a hole.

00:37:09.059 --> 00:37:14.059
So in the future, if there's even a chance

00:37:14.059 --> 00:37:18.059
that the mission might claim my better have,

00:37:18.059 --> 00:37:23.840
sign me up.

00:37:23.840 --> 00:37:26.840
Because I'd rather be in some sand-blown purgatory with you

00:37:26.840 --> 00:37:29.840
than in the hell of not knowing if I'll ever see you again.

00:37:29.840 --> 00:37:37.280
Well, I'm so sorry.

00:37:37.280 --> 00:37:39.280
I try to make choices using my human side,

00:37:39.280 --> 00:37:41.280
but sometimes my Kryptonian side takes over.

00:37:41.280 --> 00:37:49.360
I try to control the situation.

00:37:49.360 --> 00:37:57.000
Instead of hiding that side, I should try to help you understand it.

00:37:57.000 --> 00:37:58.000
But that new wedding pass.

00:37:58.000 --> 00:38:03.590
The wedding.

00:38:03.590 --> 00:38:07.409
Yeah, T minus T days.

00:38:07.409 --> 00:38:08.409
You didn't postpone it.

00:38:08.409 --> 00:38:27.360
Leaving that you would come back to me was the only thing that kept me gone.

00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:30.360
But if you want to postpone, it's fine.

00:38:30.360 --> 00:38:31.360
Lois.

00:38:31.360 --> 00:39:10.300
There's nothing in this world that could prevent me from walking down that aisle.

00:39:10.300 --> 00:39:13.300
I knew you were coming. Sneaking up on me is just showing off.

00:39:13.300 --> 00:39:17.119
Your hunch was right.

00:39:17.119 --> 00:39:22.119
The Constellation in the Veritas Journal cross-translates with Carter's notes as the bow of Orion.

00:39:22.119 --> 00:39:24.119
And is associated with these coordinates.

00:39:24.119 --> 00:39:27.119
these coordinates on the Celtic coast.

00:39:27.119 --> 00:39:29.119
Since we're still going Dutch on supersonic jet fuel,

00:39:29.119 --> 00:39:35.010
do you mind telling me why you're suddenly interested in a treasure hunt?

00:39:35.010 --> 00:39:41.679
It's not a treasure. It's, uh, it's Hawkman's quest.

00:39:41.679 --> 00:39:47.679
He saw this guy Orion used it the last time he kicked Darkside's ass halfway across the universe.

00:39:47.679 --> 00:39:51.679
But he was never able to locate the weapon that the hunter used to defeat him.

00:39:51.679 --> 00:39:54.679
My family's Veritas journals were the missing piece that Hawkman never had.

00:39:54.679 --> 00:39:56.679
Now, we know where to look for the weapon, so...

00:39:56.679 --> 00:40:00.050
So it's my job to go find it.

00:40:00.050 --> 00:40:06.679
Oliver, fighting Darkside isn't your own personal quest.

00:40:06.679 --> 00:40:08.679
We're all in this together.

00:40:08.679 --> 00:40:13.280
I just need you to trust me on this one, okay?

00:40:13.280 --> 00:40:18.909
There's enough water under our collective bridge.

00:40:18.909 --> 00:40:22.909
But if you need me not to ask questions, I can do that.

